('literature', 3, 'Which George Orwell novel features a farm run by animals?', 'Animal Farm', ARRAY['1984', 'Brave New World', 'Fahrenheit 451'], 'en', true, 'Animal Farm, published in 1945, is a satire of Stalinism.'),
