('literature', 3, 'Who wrote The Second Sex?', 'Simone de Beauvoir', ARRAY['Virginia Woolf', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Colette'], 'en', true, 'The Second Sex, published in 1949, is a foundational text of modern feminism.'),
