('literature', 3, 'Who wrote The Confessions?', 'Jean-Jacques Rousseau', ARRAY['Voltaire', 'Saint Augustine', 'Denis Diderot'], 'en', true, 'Rousseau''s Confessions, published in 1782, is a foundational autobiography.'),
('literature', 3, 'Who wrote The Outsider (L''Etranger)?', 'Albert Camus', ARRAY['Jean-Paul Sartre', 'Andre Malraux', 'Andre Gide'], 'en', true, 'The Outsider, published in 1942, is Camus''s most famous novel about Meursault.'),
