('literature', 3, 'Who wrote Slaughterhouse-Five?', 'Kurt Vonnegut', ARRAY['Joseph Heller', 'Norman Mailer', 'Thomas Pynchon'], 'en', true, 'Vonnegut published this anti-war novel in 1969, based partly on his WWII experiences.'),
