('literature', 4, 'Who wrote White Teeth?', 'Zadie Smith', ARRAY['Monica Ali', 'Andrea Levy', 'Chimamanda Ngozi Adichie'], 'en', true, 'Zadie Smith published her debut novel in 2000, exploring multicultural London.'),
